label story_01_complete (Whispers of the Void Complete)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): Three nights have passed. And still, my light has not gone out.
"Dianthus Core": The shadows learned the shape of this garden. Every path, every fence post, every gap in the thorns. But you taught them the garden bites back.
"Dianthus Core": Keep the Aether Bloom close to your chest. Rare life answers rare courage, and we will need both before the dark finds a name for what it wants.
"Dianthus Core": The next omen will not whisper from beyond the meadow. It will come closer. It will come with teeth.
